& [CanonicalP6SurfaceImplementationActivationSliceSet] is the final P6 surface implementation activation slice sequence
  + [slice] is P6-IA01 surface implementation activation boundary and exact file inventory
  + [slice] is P6-IA02 projection state authority freshness and nonpromotion model refresh
  + [slice] is P6-IA03 multi-surface projector and inbound action model refresh
  + [slice] is P6-IA04 generated projection path policy and fixture runner contract
  + [slice] is P6-IA05 surface validation tests and generated projection nonpromotion proof
  + [slice] is P6-IA06 dependency adapter transport UI Langflow dispatch operations and live-control deferral decision
  + [slice] is P6-IA07 implementation completion review proof pack and downstream readiness rebake

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes P6 surface implementation activation

